Stylized Bottle Game Asset ready for Unity and Unreal. Created in Blender 4.4 and Substance Painter. Rendered in Marmoset Toolbag 5.
Feel free tu use in your personal or comercial project.
Included:
Stylized Bottle - 1.952 tris;
Textures: 2k (2048x2048);
PNG: Base Color, Height, Metallic, Normal, Roughness;
Unity: Albedo, MetallicSmoothness, Normal; TGA (Targa);
Unreal: Base Color, Normal, Occlusion Roughness Metallic; TGA (Targa);
Formats: FBX and OBJ.
If needed, contact me. Thank you.

